%SIXMD 1
# @?MODS - LIST ACTIVE HARDWARE PROVIDERS

## DESCRIPTION

DAIMOSV1 EXPOSED AN INTERNAL KERNEL MODULE TABLE.  CURRENT DAIMOS DOES NOT
EXPORT THAT BOOT-TIME TABLE.  MODS PRESERVES THE ADMINISTRATIVE PURPOSE BY
LISTING THE ACTIVE DEVICE PROVIDERS PUBLISHED THROUGH MONITORFS.  THIS AVOIDS
RESTORING THE RETIRED SYSCTL OR DEVIO INTERFACES.

USAGE IS 'MODS'.

## @?FILES

### @?/MONITOR/DEVICES
ACTIVE DEVICE PROVIDERS AND THEIR STATE.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - PROVIDERS WERE LISTED
### @?1 - MONITORFS COULD NOT BE READ

## @?SEE ALSO

### @?DEVS
### @?SYSCTL
